  "translatedBlocks": 18,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2433fc09fb33ca9a",
      "translationZh": "WRITER 团队非常高兴地宣布，Palmyra-mini 系列的三款全新开放模型正式发布。这些模型旨在兼具强大能力与轻量化特性，并在其规模（1.5B 至 1.7B）下实现出色性能，凭借高效推理成为广泛应用场景的理想选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7192a704a09588f0",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini：一款功能强大、轻量级的非思考型基础模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43a5d67e2e72328d",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini-thinking-a：一款针对复杂推理和逻辑进行优化的专用变体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e00d6a40a45dce03",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini-thinking-b：另一款专用变体，擅长数学方程和推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e53a10a74ae363b",
      "translationZh": "这些“思考型”模型采用思维链（Chain of Thought，CoT）方法进行训练，从而提升了推理能力。我们非常期待看到社区利用这些新模型构建出怎样的应用！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55004d5305cf697b",
      "translationZh": "为方便使用，还提供了 GGUF 和 MLX 量化版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f160cd4a5633d30",
      "translationZh": "基准测试亮点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94876f75c207ebbe",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini：我们经过改进的非推理基础模型，在 Big Bench Hard (get-answer)(exact_match) 上取得了 52.6% 的成绩，是适用于各种生成式任务的出色多面手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f18648c579ae5aa",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini-thinking-a：这一变体是应对复杂逻辑挑战的首选。它采用思维链（CoT）方法训练，在 GSM8K（严格匹配）上取得了令人印象深刻的 82.87% 的成绩，展现出强大的推理能力。与本次发布的其他模型相比，它在各项基准测试中的总体平均得分最高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40da18abd88a2987",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-mini-thinking-b：这款模型不断突破问题求解的边界，在 AMC23 上取得了 92.5% 的优异成绩。当你需要一个能够通过“思考”来完成高难度任务的模型时，它是一个很好的选择。与本次发布的其他模型相比，它在 AIME24,AIME25, GPQA, HMMT25, HLE, MMLU_PRO,MATH500, LCB 这些基准测试中的平均得分最高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7c41c0e083ed910d",
      "translationZh": "基准测试说明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ca2aabcb2ff3b00",
      "translationZh": "我们同时发布 pass@1(avg-of-1) 和 pass@1(avg-of-64) 的结果。基准测试方法（采样参数：temperature 0.6，top_p 0.95）：Pass@1(avg-of-1) 得分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dd25985cd01edbe",
      "translationZh": "GSM8K 至 MBPP：使用 lm_eval 框架收集。AIME24 至 HMMT25：使用 lighteval 框架收集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89def0abab9b2c93",
      "translationZh": "Pass@1(avg-of-64) 得分：使用 nemoskills 框架收集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ff13416a6cc3fc1",
      "translationZh": "脚注：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "169ec0ba5083893d",
      "translationZh": "由于所有基础模型都采用 Qwen 架构，因此应该可以在 vLLM、SGLang、TRTLLM、TGI 等主流推理框架上运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c24cb7ff19b6cafd",
      "translationZh": "palmyra-thinking-b 的基础模型是 https://huggingface.co/nvidia/OpenReasoning-Nemotron-1.5B。我们进行了 RL 微调，并观察到它能够提升性能。虽然强化学习提高了单次作答准确率（pass@1），但也降低了采样多样性，导致 majority@64 表现相较于 SFT 基础模型有所下降。这凸显了准确率与多样性之间的权衡，我们相信，公开透明地披露这些发现，将激发围绕模式坍塌、小模型性能及其他领域的进一步研究。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "523b3bb420628238",
      "translationZh": "通过这项工作，我们尝试拓展小参数量模型所能达到的能力边界，也很期待看到社区如何在不牺牲性能质量的前提下，继续提升推理效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
